# Git Attributes Configuration for LaserLockAI

# Treat all multimedia and binary files strictly as binary (no CRLF/LF line ending modification)
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary

# Treat text files as text with automatic normalization
*.py text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.js text
*.json text
*.md text
*.txt text
*.csv text
*.css text
*.html text
